mapping "s2208.1" source="s2208" target="SNOMED_CT:81745001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source s2208 SNOMED CT 81745001 = ICF residual (a specific eyeball substructure not separately
        listed). Target (Athena 4305329) =, the eyeball parent. Why this target: the only defensible
        standard concept for an unspecified eyeball substructure is the eyeball itself. Why broader/ :
        the eyeball parent legitimately subsumes any eyeball substructure, but the residual source gives
        no indication WHICH substructure is meant, so the map loses real specificity — deeper climb than
        a one-level broader drop, hence rather than.
        """
}
